{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"BIT-phpmyadmin-2026-119562","published":"2026-11-17T11:56:22.530Z","modified":"2026-11-17T13:30:23.407151936Z","aliases":["CVE-2026-119562"],"summary":"phpMyAdmin through 5.2.3 SQL Injection via Central Columns col_extra and col_attribute","details":"phpMyAdmin through 5.2.3 contains an sql injection vulnerability that allows authenticated users to inject SQL by supplying unescaped col_extra and col_attribute values to /database/central-columns. Attackers can inject SQL into pma__central_columns INSERT and UPDATE queries run with controluser privileges, reading or modifying other users' configuration-storage data.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"phpmyadmin","ecosystem":"Bitnami","purl":"pkg:bitnami/phpmyadmin"},"ranges":[{"type":"SEMVER","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"last_affected":"5.2.3"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/bitnami/vulndb/tree/main/data/phpmyadmin/BIT-phpmyadmin-2026-119562.json"},"severity":[{"type":"CVSS_V3","score":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H"}]}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://abraxaslabs.tech/research/phpmyadmin-pmadb-central-sqli"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://github.com/phpmyadmin/phpmyadmin"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://github.com/phpmyadmin/phpmyadmin/blob/RELEASE_5_2_3/libraries/classes/Database/CentralColumns.php#L268"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://github.com/phpmyadmin/phpmyadmin/blob/RELEASE_5_2_3/libraries/classes/Database/CentralColumns.php#L637-L638"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-119562"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/phpmyadmin-through-5.2.3-sql-injection-via-central-columns-col-extra-and-col-attribute"}],"database_specific":{"cpes":["cpe:2.3:a:phpmyadmin:phpmyadmin:*:*:*:*:*:php:*:*"],"severity":"High"}}